        <div class="card-glow-bg"></div>
        <div class="card-icon-box">
          <span class="card-emoji">🎧</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-category-title">Customer Support & Sales</h3>
        <p class="card-category-desc">Drive customer satisfaction, lead acquisition, and business development with high-touch specialists.</p>
