          <li onclick="openRoleModal('Customer Service Representatives', 'Customer Support & Sales', 'Deliver exceptional multi-channel support across phone, chat, and email to ensure customer satisfaction and rapid issue resolution.', ['Multi-channel CX Support', 'CRM Management', 'Ticket Resolution & Escalation'])">
