            <span>Lead generators</span>
            <span class="arrow-icon">→</span>
          </li>
          <li onclick="openRoleModal('Business Development Executives', 'Customer Support & Sales', 'Expand your market presence by identifying strategic growth areas, nurturing corporate partnerships, and closing key accounts.', ['B2B Outreach & Deal Closing', 'Strategic Account Growth', 'Pipeline Management'])">
            <span>Business development executives</span>
            <span class="arrow-icon">→</span>
